<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound interbank rates mostly stable.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound interbank rates mostly stable.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound were almost unchanged on Tuesday, ranging between 8-1/4 and 9-1/4 percent, compared to 8-1/4 and nine percent on Monday, bankers said.</p>
<p>Some bankers said the market had been short since Sunday.</p>
<p>One-week rates were also barely changed at 8-1/2 and nine percent, compared to Monday's range of 8-1/2 and 8-7/8 percent.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom + 202 578 3290/1</p>
